  assert: CHECK(same_bits(windows, c.corrected))

[case] tests/loop_fine_time_test.cpp :: loop fine time corridor: equal jambs every 2 m do not move a right trajectory by more than one grid step
  markers: -
  call: build_corridor(c, jambs, nullptr, nullptr)
